      "raw": "[quote=\"Spiff\"]\n\nYou guys sure have a lot of cons in the midwest. &nbsp;Must not be a whole lot else to do out there. :P\n\n[/quote]\n\n&nbsp;\n\nYou&#39;re absolutely right, of course.\n\n&nbsp;\n\nBrock came by to say hi. Thanks, Brock!\n\n&nbsp;\n\nThe game room was surprisingly well attended, and much larger than I&#39;d expected. I figure there were chairs for 100 people in there and most of the afternoon they were all taken. I had no trouble finding people to play Sentinels. Had to turn some people away. Ok, it didn&#39;t help that we played a 90 minute game against La Capitan (but won!). The Whos Yer Gamers library also had two copies of Sentinels and they were both checked out most of the day, too.\n",
