    {
      "id": 95769,
      "name": "arenson9",
      "username": "arenson9",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/{size}/1900_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-03-16T23:43:04.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Thanks again for your help today, Brock!</p><p>The location of the gaming got moved a bit more out of the way today than yesterday, but the room still filled up pretty well. Except for a brief lull, there was no shortage of people interested in playing. I also happened across a couple of groups who'd checked out Sentinels from the library w/out having played it before and helped them get started.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>One of the people who played in a game w/ me started messaging a friend who apparently supplies all of his games at a discount to find out how much it would cost to get Sentinels, all four expansions, and all six mini-expansions ($135, btw). Not bad for 1,753 cards, I think.</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:22:41.930Z",
